      "en": "The king of Babylon made Mattaniah, Jehoiachin’s father’s brother, king in his place, and changed his name to Zedekiah.",
      "ko": "바벨론 왕이 또 여호야긴의 아자비 맛다니야로 대신하여 왕을 삼고 그 이름을 고쳐 시드기야라 하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "48b888e922ce373610a755c5a6a26e40cf4f3b446e23b340725db46d5865ddb0",
      "translation_text_hash": "9642a7d4221715912e95c01bbb057d5017fbaf4271d83bee6dcacac83de9967a",
